ines&quot; is accepted by IEEE VIS 2024 Arts Program as a pictorial.</li><li><span class=\"leaf\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎉</span> [07/2024] Our paper &quot;Visual Analysis of Complex Temporal Networks Supported by Analytic Provenance&quot; is accepted by IEEE VAST Challenge 2024 MC3 and received 🏆 Honorable mention solution.</li><li><span class=\"leaf\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎨</span> [06/2024] Our program City Pulse is to be exhibited in China VISAP&#39;24. </li><li><span class=\"leaf\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎨</span> [04/2024] Our program City Pulse is shortlisted in Visual Data Storytelling contest, PacificVis 2024.</li><li><span class=\"leaf\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎨</span> [08/2023] Our program Timber Architecture won the Third Prize in the Digital Humanities track of the ChinaVis 2023 Visualization Contest.</li><li><span class=\"leaf\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎨</span> [08/2022] Our program Visualization of Wang Xizhi&#39;s Calligraphy Series received an Honorable Mention in the ChinaVis 2022 Visualization Contest.</li></ul></div>", 2);
